  "name": {
   "zh": "深度与摄影机 · LingBot-Map",
   "en": "Depth and Camera · LingBot-Map"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "LingBot-Map 官方自述是流式的前馈三维基础模型，518×378 下超过一万帧的长图像序列仍能约 20 FPS 稳定推理。这张卡交付每帧摄影机（USD 与 Nuke 摄影机，都是去抖后的）和深度贴图（对应原始摄影机）；不出点云（放出的权重没有点图头），要点云接「深度转点云」。去抖没有旁路。",
   "en": "LingBot-Map describes itself as a streaming feed-forward 3D foundation model that keeps stable inference at about 20 FPS at 518×378 on sequences of over ten thousand frames. This card delivers per-frame cameras (USD and Nuke camera, both deshaken) and depth maps (for the original camera); no point cloud (the released weights have no pointmap head), so wire Points from Depth if you need one. The deshake has no bypass."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "depth_long",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
